{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>את פני</b> — the wisdom, that he will learn it from every person." "<b>בקצה ארץ</b> — they wander about to seek wisdom, for he considers the people of his place fools like himself; therefore he angers his father by desiring to go far off."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:24.391866036Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}